# B-296: Unit constructor evaluator-level injection
# Unit constructors from [type ...] declarations are injected by the evaluator
# as dict entries. The TypeDecl entry itself is skipped.
[
  Transport: [type Tcp Udp]
  tcp-val: Tcp
  udp-val: Udp
]
=== out
Dict({"Tcp": Variant(Tcp, Null), "Udp": Variant(Udp, Null), "tcp-val": Variant(Tcp, Null), "udp-val": Variant(Udp, Null)})
